{%- comment -%}
  PROJECT SHADES — one result card.

  This section exists only to be fetched by the Section Rendering API:

      /products/<handle>?section_id=shades-quiz-card

  Requesting it against a product URL puts that product in scope, so it can
  hand back the theme's own `card-product` markup. That is how the fitting
  room's recommendations end up identical to the cards on every collection
  page — same badges, same price formatting, same sale highlighting — instead
  of being a lookalike maintained separately in JavaScript.

  Quick-add is off on purpose: these frames come in colourways, so the customer
  should land on the product page and choose one.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- render 'card-product',
  card_product: product,
  media_aspect_ratio: settings.card_img_aspect_ratio,
  show_price: true,
  show_sale_badges: settings.badges_show_sale,
  show_vendor: settings.show_vendor,
  show_quick_add: false,
  lazy_load: false,
  section_id: section.id
-%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Fitting quiz result card",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
